    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d544">

                <pb facs="0772" n="752" xml:id="pg752"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr. Burnley.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-10-25"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >October</hi> 25, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your communication of the 20th instant, relative to the alleged capture of
                    the Night Hawk, and the detention of her crew as prisoners; and, in reply, to
                    inform you that I have transmitted a copy thereof to the Secretary of the Navy,
                    who has been requested to investigate the case, with a view to the adoption of
                    such proceedings as the result may call for.</p>
                <p>Accept, sir, a renewed assurance of my high consideration,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">J. Hume Burnley,</hi> Esq., <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
